2020-04-14","l":60,"d":"Jewel performs “Hands”, “Who Will Save Your Soul”, and her new song “Grateful”.","img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/7996947/screencap/6331a4fc2d456.jpg"},{"s":2020,"e":8,"t":"Shaggy","a":"2020-04-17","l":60,"d":"Shaggy performs “It Wasn’t Me,” “Angel,” and more.","img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/7996948/screencap/6331a56bc8d95.jpg"},{"s":2020,"e":9,"t":"Kiana Ledé","a":"2020-04-21","l":60,"d":"Check out her soothing and smooth performance of \"Mat At Me\", \"Ex\" and a cover of Rihanna's hit \"Take A Bow”.","img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/7996949/screencap/6331a5c107602.jpg"},{"s":2020,"e":10,"t":"Monsta X","a":"2020-04-24","l":60,"d":"Monsta X performs “Beside U” and “You Can’t Hold My Heart”.","img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/7996950/screencap/6331a658059ff.jpg"},{"s":2020,"e":11,"t":"Bazzi","a":"2020-05-01","l":60,"d":"Bazzi performs “Renee’s Song”, “Young and Alive”, and covers Snow Patrol’s “Chasing Cars”.","img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/7996951/screencap/6331a6a77f68d.jpg"},{"s":2020,"e":12,"t":"Marcus Mumford","a":"2020-05-05","l":60,"d":"Marcus Mumford performs “Fare Thee Well,” “Lay Your Head On Me,” and “You’ll Never Walk Alone”.","img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/7996952/screencap/6331a6e753c44.jpg"},{"s":2020,"e":13,"t":"CNCO","a":"2020-05-08","l":60,"d":"CNCO performs “De Cero” and “Honey Boo”.","img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/7996953/screencap/6331a7b702016.jpg"},{"s":2020,"e":14,"t":"Hayley Kiyoko","a":"2020-05-12","l":60,"d":"Hayley Kiyoko performs “Gravel To Tempo” and “Sleepover”.","img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/7996954/screencap/6331a8163dde5.jpg"},{"s":2020,"e":15,"t":"Miley Cyrus Backyard Sessions 2020","a":"2020-10-16","l":60,"d":"Miley Cyrus performs an acoustic set of original songs and covers including Britney Spears's \"Gimme More,\" and is 